 <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#site","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/","name":"Bitcoin Wealth Guide by MTG","alternateName":["Bitcoin Wealth Guide","MTG Bitcoin Wealth","mtgtribe.com/bw"],"description":"Independent, plain-English Bitcoin Wealth education by MTG: how it works, how to join safely, free tools, and how to check every payment on the blockchain.","inLanguage":"en-ZA","publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg","name":"MTG","alternateName":["MusaTheGiant","Musa the Giant"],"jobTitle":"Your Digital Architect","description":"MTG, Your Digital Architect: creator of independent, plain-English crypto education, videos and free tools, and host of the MTG TRIBE community.","url":"https://www.musathegiant.com","sameAs":["https://www.musathegiant.com","https://www.tiktok.com/@joinmtgtribe","https://www.youtube.com/@mtgtribe","https://www.facebook.com/mtgtribe","https://t.me/mtgtribe"],"knowsAbout":["Bitcoin","Bitcoin Wealth","BTCB","Web3 wallets","SafePal","BNB Smart Chain","Crypto safety","Affiliate marketing"]},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/#webpage","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/","name":"Bitcoin Wealth vs a stokvel: 6 questions, side by side, in 4 minutes","description":"Is Bitcoin Wealth just a stokvel online? Thandi asks 6 honest questions, Leo answers side by side and shows where the picture stops. Every word written.","inLanguage":"en-ZA","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#site"},"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"about":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Bitcoin Wealth","alternateName":["BW","Bitcoin Wealth Vow Unity"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"isAccessibleForFree":true,"datePublished":"2026-11-14","dateModified":"2026-11-22","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/#breadcrumb"},"video":[{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/#video-e4"}],"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/img/bitcoin-wealth-better-than-a-stokvel-video-preview.jpg?v=78f52c45","width":1200,"height":630}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Bitcoin Wealth guide","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Dashboard","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Explainer Videos","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Explainer 4: Better than a stokvel?","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/#breadcrumb"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Bitcoin Wealth vs a stokvel: 6 questions, side by side, explained in 4 minutes, with Thandi and Leo","description":"Thandi asks if Bitcoin Wealth is just a stokvel on the internet, and Leo answers six honest questions side by side: who holds the money, who can see the payments, the fees, what it pays in, how much you put in, and whether your turn is guaranteed.","thumbnailUrl":["https://mtgtribe.com/bw/img/bitcoin-wealth-vs-stokvel-6-questions-side-by-side.webp"],"uploadDate":"2026-11-23T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT3M56S","contentUrl":"https://media.bitcoinwealthpays.com/videos/bitcoin-wealth-vs-stokvel-6-questions-side-by-side.mp4","encodingFormat":"video/mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA","isFamilyFriendly":true,"isAccessibleForFree":true,"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"about":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Bitcoin Wealth","alternateName":["BW","Bitcoin Wealth Vow Unity"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"width":1280,"height":720,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/","transcript":"Thandi: Leo, my mom's stokvel has paid out for 20 years. Is Bitcoin Wealth just a stokvel on the internet? Leo: In some ways, it's better. In one big way, it's different. Welcome back, family, and well done for coming back to learn. Today: 6 questions, side by side. Leo: First, the stokvel. Every month, the members put in the same amount. The treasurer keeps the money in the tin, and writes it all in the book. And each month, one member takes the pot home, until everyone has had a turn. Thandi: And in Bitcoin Wealth? Who holds the money? Leo: No treasurer, and no tin. That's the first big difference. Leo: When a member pays for a slot, the smart contract passes the payment straight on, to other members' own wallets. Only the Royal Pool waits in the contract. That's called peer to peer: from one member, straight to another. Thandi: And in my mom's stokvel, I only see the book when the treasurer shows it. Leo: Here, the book is open to everyone, forever. You read it on BscScan. Leo: Every activation and every payout since April 2026 is a public record. Picture a stokvel with over 41,000 member IDs, where anyone can check every single payment, from a phone. Thandi: So no more praying the treasurer is honest! Leo: Three more, quickly. There's no bank in the middle, so no bank charges: only small network fees in BNB. A stokvel pays in rand. Bitcoin Wealth pays in BTCB, Bitcoin's value, and Bitcoin's price moves up and down. And a stokvel asks you to pay in every month, for the whole cycle. Thandi: And Bitcoin Wealth? Every month too? Leo: One entry. 0.001 Bitcoin, once. Thandi: Okay, Leo, be straight with me. In my mom's stokvel, everyone gets a turn. Is my turn guaranteed here? Leo: No. And this is where the stokvel picture stops. A stokvel is a closed circle: the same members keep paying, so every turn comes around. Leo: Bitcoin Wealth is an open circle. Your cycle fills only when real members activate the positions below you. So it grows as the community grows, and nothing is guaranteed. Thandi: So that's why teaching others matters! Thandi: Let me say it back. No treasurer: payments go wallet to wallet. The book is open on BscScan. No bank charges, and one entry, once. But it's open: my cycle fills only when real members join below me. Leo: That's it! You've got it. And that's how we learn best: by teaching others. Leo: This is education, not financial advice. So take your time, and do your own research. Thandi: What's next, Leo? Leo: Next: the open book. I'll show you how to check it yourself, on BscScan. Leo: And when you're ready to start, every step is at mtgtribe.com/bw. Thandi: See you there! Leo: If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together. Leo: Thank you for watching. Take good care of yourself, and of the people you love. We can't wait to welcome you. Goodbye for now.","hasPart":[{"@type":"Clip","name":"Is it just a stokvel on the internet?","startOffset":0,"endOffset":20,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=0"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"How a stokvel works","startOffset":20,"endOffset":35,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=20"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Question 1: who holds the money?","startOffset":35,"endOffset":58,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=35"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Question 2: can you see every payment?","startOffset":58,"endOffset":89,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=58"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Questions 3 to 5: fees, what it pays in, how much","startOffset":89,"endOffset":119,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=89"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Question 6: is your turn guaranteed?","startOffset":119,"endOffset":150,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=119"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Thandi says it back","startOffset":150,"endOffset":169,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=150"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Your next step","startOffset":169,"endOffset":236,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/?t=169"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/#video-e4","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/better-than-a-stokvel-video/#webpage"}}]}</script>
