by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"isAccessibleForFree":true,"datePublished":"2026-11-14","dateModified":"2026-11-22","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/#breadcrumb"},"video":[{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/#video-e2"}],"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/img/bitcoin-wealth-how-the-14-positions-pay-video-preview.jpg?v=d34e022c","width":1200,"height":630}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Bitcoin Wealth guide","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Dashboard","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Explainer Videos","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Explainer 2: The 14 positions","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/#breadcrumb"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"How Bitcoin Wealth pays: the 14 positions explained in 3 minutes, with Thandi and Leo","description":"Thandi asks, Leo draws it out seat by seat: 2, then 4, then 8 positions under you, where each of the 14 payments goes, the Royal Pool from your second cycle, who fills the seats, and why there is no withdraw button.","thumbnailUrl":["https://mtgtribe.com/bw/img/how-bitcoin-wealth-pays-14-positions-explained.webp"],"uploadDate":"2026-11-21T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT3M19S","contentUrl":"https://media.bitcoinwealthpays.com/videos/how-bitcoin-wealth-pays-14-positions-explained.mp4","encodingFormat":"video/mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA","isFamilyFriendly":true,"isAccessibleForFree":true,"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"about":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Bitcoin Wealth","alternateName":["BW","Bitcoin Wealth Vow Unity"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"width":1280,"height":720,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/","transcript":"Thandi: Leo, you said every payout is another member's slot payment. So who pays who? Leo: Picture 14 seats. Fill them with me, and you'll see where every single payment goes. Thandi: 14 seats? Where are they? Leo: Below you sit 2 seats, then 4, then 8. 14 in all. Each seat is one member paying the slot price, and each seat makes one payment. Thandi: Okay. So where does each payment go? Leo: Row 1. Seats 1 and 2 pay your upline, the two members above you. Leo: Row 2. Seats 3 and 6 go straight to your wallet. Seats 4 and 5 buy your next slot. Leo: Row 3. Seats 8, 9, 11 and 12 go to your wallet too. 7, 10 and 13 go to members below you. And seat 14 puts you back into the same slot, so it can fill again. Thandi: Wait. So how many of the 14 come to me? Leo: Nine. 6 to your wallet, 2 buy your next slot, and 1 starts you again. Thandi: And the other five? Leo: 2 go up, to your upline. 3 go down, to members below you. The same rules, for every member. Thandi: And when seat 14 starts me again? Leo: From your second cycle in a slot, seat 4 goes to the Royal Pool and seat 5 goes to your wallet. So 7 to your wallet. Your next slot is already bought. Thandi: Okay, Leo, honestly. Who fills all these seats? Leo: Members. The people you introduce, and sometimes people from your upline's team, when it overflows. That's called spillover. Leo: But every seat needs a real member. Nothing fills by itself, and nothing is guaranteed. That's why sharing and teaching matter. Thandi: And I don't have to ask anyone for my payment? Leo: No. There's no withdraw button. The contract splits each payment and sends it straight to members' own wallets, in the same transaction. Thandi: Let me say it back. 2, 4, 8: 14 seats, 14 payments. 2 go up, 3 go down. 6 to my wallet, 2 buy my next slot, and 1 starts me again. Leo: That's it! You've got it. And that's how we learn best: by teaching others. Leo: This is education, not financial advice. So take your time, and do your own research. Thandi: What's next, Leo? Leo: Next: the 12 slots, and why you only pay once. Leo: And when you're ready to start, every step is at mtgtribe.com/bw. Thandi: See you there! Leo: If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together. Leo: Thank you for watching. Take good care of yourself, and of the people you love. We can't wait to welcome you. Goodbye for now.","hasPart":[{"@type":"Clip","name":"Who pays who? 14 seats, 14 payments","startOffset":0,"endOffset":27,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=0"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Where each of the 14 payments goes","startOffset":27,"endOffset":55,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=27"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"9 of 14 point to you","startOffset":55,"endOffset":74,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=55"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"From your second cycle: the Royal Pool","startOffset":74,"endOffset":87,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=74"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Who fills the seats? Spillover","startOffset":87,"endOffset":109,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=87"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"No withdraw button","startOffset":109,"endOffset":121,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=109"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Thandi says it back","startOffset":121,"endOffset":134,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=121"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Your next step","startOffset":134,"endOffset":198,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/?t=134"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/#video-e2","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/how-the-14-positions-pay-video/#webpage"}}]}</script>
