"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"width":1280,"height":720,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/","transcript":"Thandi: Leo, you said seats 4 and 5 buy my next slot. How many slots are there? Leo: 12. And here's the best part: you only pay for the first one. Thandi: Only the first one? Show me. Leo: Slot 1 costs 0.001 Bitcoin. Every slot after it costs double: 0.002, 0.004, and so on, up to slot 12, 2.048 Bitcoin. Thandi: Double every time? So who pays for slot 2? Leo: Your first cycle does. Seats 4 and 5 are two members, each paying 0.001. Together that's 0.002: exactly the price of slot 2. So slot 2 is bought for you, automatically. Thandi: Oh! So that's why every slot is double! Leo: Exactly. Two payments at one slot buy the next one. Slot 2's first cycle buys slot 3, and so on, all the way up. Thandi: So what do I actually pay? Leo: 0.001 Bitcoin, once, plus small network fees in BNB. No monthly fee, and no upgrade fees. Thandi: Okay, Leo, be straight with me. What has to happen for me to move up? Leo: One thing: seat 5. When real members fill seats 4 and 5 of your first cycle, your next slot opens. Leo: Your business partners fill the seats, and sometimes spillover from above. The moment seat 5 is filled, slot 2 opens, while seats 6 to 14 keep filling. Nothing moves by itself, and nothing is guaranteed. Thandi: And once I'm in a slot, can I lose it? Leo: The programme says slots never expire. Each time a cycle completes, seat 14 starts you again in the same slot. Thandi: Let me say it back. 12 slots, each one double. I pay for slot 1 only, once. Seats 4 and 5 buy my next slot. So I move up when seat 5 fills. Leo: That's it! You've got it. And that's how we learn best: by teaching others. Leo: This is education, not financial advice. So take your time, and do your own research. Thandi: What's next, Leo? Leo: Next: Bitcoin Wealth and the stokvel, side by side. Leo: And when you're ready to start, every step is at mtgtribe.com/bw. Thandi: See you there! Leo: If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together. Leo: Thank you for watching. Take good care of yourself, and of the people you love. We can't wait to welcome you. Goodbye for now.","hasPart":[{"@type":"Clip","name":"How many slots? 12, each one double","startOffset":0,"endOffset":30,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=0"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Who pays for slot 2?","startOffset":30,"endOffset":64,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=30"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"What you actually pay: 0.001 BTC, once","startOffset":64,"endOffset":76,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=64"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"What has to happen to move up","startOffset":76,"endOffset":105,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=76"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Can you lose a slot?","startOffset":105,"endOffset":119,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=105"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Thandi says it back","startOffset":119,"endOffset":132,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=119"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Your next step","startOffset":132,"endOffset":197,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/?t=132"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/#video-e3","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/the-12-slots-video/#webpage"}}]}</script>
