out":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Bitcoin Wealth","alternateName":["BW","Bitcoin Wealth Vow Unity"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"width":1280,"height":720,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/","transcript":"Thandi: Leo, everybody keeps talking about Bitcoin Wealth. Is it a coin? Can I buy it? Leo: No, Thandi. You can't buy Bitcoin Wealth. And once you see why, it all clicks. Thandi: Okay. Then start at the beginning. What is Bitcoin? Leo: Bitcoin is digital money that no bank controls. Leo: It started in 2009, and only 21 million will ever exist. That's why people call it digital gold. Thandi: So where does Bitcoin Wealth come in? Leo: You know a stokvel. People put money together, a treasurer holds it, and she keeps the book. Thandi: And everybody prays she's honest! Leo: Exactly. Bitcoin Wealth is not a coin. It's a smart contract. Leo: A program on the blockchain that follows fixed rules. When a member pays for a slot, the program sends that payment straight to other members' own wallets. And the book is open for anyone to read. Thandi: And it pays in real Bitcoin? Leo: It pays in BTCB. That's Bitcoin's value on BNB Smart Chain. One BTCB tracks one Bitcoin, and you can swap it for Bitcoin. Thandi: And BNB? I keep hearing BNB. Leo: BNB pays the network fee. It's the postage stamp. No stamp, nothing moves. Thandi: Now be straight with me, Leo. Where does the money come from? Leo: From members. Every payout is another member's slot payment, passed on by the program. Leo: No trading. No mining. So it grows when the community grows, and nothing is guaranteed. Thandi: And what does it cost to start? Leo: One entry. 0.001 Bitcoin, once. Thandi: And I must just take your word for it? Leo: Never. Every payment is public. You can check it yourself, any time. Thandi: So let me say it back. Bitcoin is the money. Bitcoin Wealth is the program that passes it on, wallet to wallet. Thandi: BTCB is Bitcoin's value on BNB Smart Chain. And BNB is the stamp. Leo: That's it! You've got it. And that's how we learn best: by teaching others. Leo: This is education, not financial advice. So take your time, and do your own research. Thandi: What's next, Leo? Leo: Next: how the 14 positions pay. Leo: And when you're ready to start, every step is at mtgtribe.com/bw. Thandi: See you there!","hasPart":[{"@type":"Clip","name":"Is Bitcoin Wealth a coin?","startOffset":0,"endOffset":15,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=0"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"What is Bitcoin?","startOffset":15,"endOffset":31,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=15"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"The stokvel, the tin and the book","startOffset":31,"endOffset":45,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=31"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Not a coin: a smart contract","startOffset":45,"endOffset":63,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=45"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"BTCB and BNB, in plain words","startOffset":63,"endOffset":85,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=63"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Where does the money come from?","startOffset":85,"endOffset":110,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=85"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Check it yourself, then say it back","startOffset":110,"endOffset":142,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=110"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Your next step","startOffset":142,"endOffset":179,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/?t=142"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/#video-e1","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/what-is-bitcoin-wealth-video/#webpage"}}]}</script>
