ntUrl":"https://media.bitcoinwealthpays.com/videos/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website.mp4","encodingFormat":"video/mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA","isFamilyFriendly":true,"isAccessibleForFree":true,"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"about":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Bitcoin Wealth","alternateName":["BW","Bitcoin Wealth Vow Unity"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"width":1280,"height":720,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/","transcript":"Leo: What if this whole guide worked for you, day and night, with your link on every Join button? Thandi: Leo, thank you! Five videos, and you answered every single question I had. Leo: It's been my pleasure. Welcome back, family! Thandi: I love this guide. Can I get one just like it, but mine? With my own link, my WhatsApp and my socials? Leo: Yes, you can! MTG builds it for you: your own Bitcoin Wealth marketing website. Leo: Picture it. This whole guide, every tutorial and every explainer, with MTG's branding taken off, and your name on it. Your Bitcoin Wealth referral link on every Join button, so everyone who joins there joins your team. Your WhatsApp number as a button, your WhatsApp group, and your TikTok, Facebook, YouTube, Telegram and Instagram. It's ready the same day, with 5 free edits, like adding your other income streams. Thandi: I love it! How much is it? Leo: R1,000 once-off, if you pay in rand. Or $50 in USDT, the digital dollar. And you only pay once it's built, and you've seen it. Thandi: R1,000 once-off? And then? Do I pay for the domain? The hosting? Something every month? Leo: Not a cent more. MTG pays for all of it. Leo: Think about what keeps a website like this alive. The domain, bitcoinwealthpays.com, and its renewal every year. Hosting, so it's online 24/7. Your videos play from MTG's own video storage: no YouTube ads, and no one else's videos pulling your visitors away. The padlock that keeps every page secure. Updates, maintenance, and new videos as MTG makes them. MTG covers all of it, every month, every year. You pay once. Thandi: And if I change my WhatsApp number, or start a new group? I'm not a tech person. Leo: You don't need to be. 5 free edits are included. MTG builds it, sets up every link, and tests every button. It's ready the same day. And look at what you get: more than 10 videos, about 45 minutes of teaching, 3 live tools, and more than 30 pages, working for you 24/7, even while you sleep. Leo: Do the maths. R1,000 is less than R3 a day, for one year. Then nothing more to pay. Honestly? With MTG paying the running costs, you're getting the better side of this deal. Thandi: I pay once, and MTG keeps paying? That's a no-brainer! Thandi: Wait. $50 is less than R1,000. Why is crypto cheaper? Leo: Because MTG wants you to get comfortable with crypto payments. You can pay straight from your own wallet, like SafePal, MetaMask or TokenPocket. Or from an exchange, like VALR or Binance. Thandi: Ooh. What's the difference between them? Leo: VALR and Binance are centralised. The exchange holds the keys for you, a bit like a bank holds your money. They're great for buying crypto with rand, and the buttons and tutorials are right there on the site. SafePal, MetaMask and TokenPocket are decentralised, also called self-custody: you hold the keys. And MTG highly recommends them. Here's why. Leo: One: you own your private keys, so only you control your crypto. Not your keys, not your coins. Two: no exchange can freeze your account, or hold back your withdrawal. Three: it connects straight to smart contracts. That's how you join Bitcoin Wealth, with SafePal, in Tutorial 1. And four: it's right there on your phone, wherever you are in the world. The one rule: your recovery phrase is your key. Write it down, keep it offline, and never share it with anyone. Not even MTG. Leo: And crypto is fast: it arrives in minutes, any day of the week, even across borders. Thandi: So the discount is a little crypto lesson. Now that makes sense! But how will people find my website? Leo: Great question. It all comes down to traffic. Thandi: Wait, Leo. Before you go on: what is traffic? Leo: Not the cars on the road! Online, traffic means people. Every person who opens your website is a visitor. Every pair of eyes that sees your link is an eyeball. When someone taps your link, that's a click. And when a visitor takes action, like joining with your link, that's a conversion. More eyes, more clicks, more chances at a yes. Thandi: Traffic is people! Now I get it. So how do I get traffic? Leo: Three ways. One: when you go live on TikTok, say your address out loud: bitcoinwealthpays.com/yourname. Two: put it in your TikTok bio. Most personal accounts need about 1,000 followers before TikTok lets you add a clickable link. And three: ClickBaitPays. Thandi: ClickBaitPays? What's that? Leo: A traffic source. Got a link? Get it seen. You put your link in an ad, and real ClickBaitPays members open it and look at it, every day. They're paid in USDT to view the ads, so they really look. And they already use crypto, so a sign-up link is everyday stuff for them. MTG runs ads for his own Bitcoin Wealth website on ClickBaitPays, and people have joined Bitcoin Wealth from those ads. Leo: And there's more: as a member, you're paid to view ads too. A traffic source, and an income stream. Leo: Learn all about it, step by step, at clickbaitpaysus.com. Thandi: But Leo, what if I couldn't even find two people? Leo: Then this is for you. Not everyone can go live for hours, or explain the whole plan. Your website does the explaining. The videos do the teaching. ClickBaitPays brings the eyes. And the people it speaks to can join with your link, on their own. Nothing is guaranteed, but you're no longer doing it alone. Leo: Think about it. Some people work a day shift here and a night shift there, just to earn more. The internet makes more than one stream so much easier: your Bitcoin Wealth website, ClickBaitPays, and even a ClickBaitPays marketing website of your own. Thandi: A whole series of streams. Now I get it! So how do I order mine? Leo: Go to bitcoinwealthpays.com/bwcopy. Type your name the way it should appear, and your WhatsApp number. Then the name at the end of your address: bitcoinwealthpays.com/yourname. Paste your Bitcoin Wealth referral link: every Join button will carry it. Add your WhatsApp group, and your VALR and Binance links if you have them. Your socials are optional. Choose how you'd like to pay, then tap Send my order on WhatsApp. WhatsApp opens with everything filled in: press send, and share your profile photo in the same chat. MTG builds it, you check it, and you only pay when you're happy. Thandi: Let me say it back. My own Bitcoin Wealth marketing website, with my link on every Join button. Thandi: R1,000, or $50 in USDT. Traffic means people. ClickBaitPays brings the eyes. Thandi: And no monthly fees: MTG pays the domain, the hosting and the updates. I pay once. Leo: That's it! You've got it. And that's how we learn best: by teaching others. Leo: So, why wait? Order yours today at bitcoinwealthpays.com/bwcopy. It's ready the same day, and you only pay once you've seen it, and you love it. Thandi: I'm ordering mine right now! Leo: And if you lead a team, send them this video. Every builder can have their own. Leo: This is education, not financial advice. So take your time, and do your own research. Thandi: What's next, Leo? Leo: Next: more on traffic, and more on crypto. Together. Leo: And when you're ready to start, every step is at mtgtribe.com/bw. Thandi: See you there! Leo: If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together. Leo: Thank you for watching. Take good care of yourself, and of the people you love. We can't wait to welcome you. Goodbye for now.","hasPart":[{"@type":"Clip","name":"Can I get my own website?","startOffset":0,"endOffset":32,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=0"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"What you get","startOffset":32,"endOffset":60,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=32"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"The price: R1,000 or $50 in USDT","startOffset":60,"endOffset":72,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=60"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"No monthly fees: what MTG pays for","startOffset":72,"endOffset":116,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=72"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"No tech skills needed, and the maths","startOffset":116,"endOffset":164,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=116"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Why is crypto cheaper?","startOffset":164,"endOffset":183,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=164"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Your own wallet or an exchange?","startOffset":183,"endOffset":251,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=183"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"What is traffic?","startOffset":251,"endOffset":289,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=251"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"3 ways to get traffic","startOffset":289,"endOffset":314,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=289"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"ClickBaitPays, a traffic source","startOffset":314,"endOffset":354,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=314"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"What if I couldn't find even 2 people?","startOffset":354,"endOffset":379,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=354"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"A series of streams","startOffset":379,"endOffset":395,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=379"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"How to order yours","startOffset":395,"endOffset":440,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=395"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Thandi says it back","startOffset":440,"endOffset":468,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=440"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Order yours today","startOffset":468,"endOffset":481,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=468"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Lead a team? Send them this video","startOffset":481,"endOffset":488,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=481"},{"@type":"Clip","name":"Next video, and goodbye","startOffset":488,"endOffset":546,"url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/?t=488"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/#video-e6","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/explainers/your-own-bitcoin-wealth-marketing-website-video/#webpage"}}]}</script>
