 <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#site","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/","name":"Bitcoin Wealth Guide by MTG","alternateName":["Bitcoin Wealth Guide","MTG Bitcoin Wealth","mtgtribe.com/bw"],"description":"Independent, plain-English Bitcoin Wealth education by MTG: how it works, how to join safely, free tools, and how to check every payment on the blockchain.","inLanguage":"en-ZA","publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg","name":"MTG","alternateName":["MusaTheGiant","Musa the Giant"],"jobTitle":"Your Digital Architect","description":"MTG, Your Digital Architect: creator of independent, plain-English crypto education, videos and free tools, and host of the MTG TRIBE community.","url":"https://www.musathegiant.com","sameAs":["https://www.musathegiant.com","https://www.tiktok.com/@joinmtgtribe","https://www.youtube.com/@mtgtribe","https://www.facebook.com/mtgtribe","https://t.me/mtgtribe"],"knowsAbout":["Bitcoin","Bitcoin Wealth","BTCB","Web3 wallets","SafePal","BNB Smart Chain","Crypto safety","Affiliate marketing"]},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/#webpage","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/","name":"Bitcoin Wealth FAQ: straight answers | MTG","description":"Straight answers about Bitcoin Wealth: costs, BTCB, fees, auto entry, the Royal Pool, safety, the admin controls and what happens if growth stops.","inLanguage":"en-ZA","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#site"},"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/#mtg"},"about":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Bitcoin Wealth","alternateName":["BW","Bitcoin Wealth Vow Unity"],"description":"A Bitcoin matrix programme run by a smart contract on BNB Smart Chain: members enter once with 0.001 BTC (as BTCB) and payments move wallet to wallet."},"isAccessibleForFree":true,"datePublished":"2026-11-14","dateModified":"2026-11-22","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/#breadcrumb"},"hasPart":[{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/#faqpage"}],"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/img/bitcoin-wealth-faq-preview.jpg?v=71292857","width":1200,"height":630}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Bitcoin Wealth guide","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Dashboard","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"FAQ","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/"}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/#breadcrumb"},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Bitcoin Wealth in one sentence?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A smart contract on BNB Smart Chain where members activate slots with BTCB, and each payment goes straight to other members' wallets by fixed rules."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does it cost to start?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Slot 1 costs 0.001 BTC (paid as BTCB), plus small network fees in BNB. It's a once-off: slots 2 to 12 are bought automatically from the cycle below, as soon as its seat 5 is filled."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it guaranteed to pay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Every payout comes from another member's slot payment. If new activations slow down, payouts slow down. Only use money you can afford to lose."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I join Bitcoin Wealth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In three stages, all on your phone: set up a SafePal wallet, buy BNB with rand on VALR or Binance and send it to SafePal, then swap it to BTCB and activate slot 1 with the link of the person who invited you. Three tutorial videos show every tap, and each has its steps in writing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you earn Bitcoin with Bitcoin Wealth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"By the plan's rules, when the 14 positions below you fill, six of those payments land in your own wallet as BTCB (Bitcoin's value on BNB Smart Chain), two buy your next slot and one recycles you. Every payment comes from another member activating a slot, so it depends on those positions filling: nothing is guaranteed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I have to introduce people?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sponsoring two people is the first qualifier (Ignite) and switches on spillover. There's no upper limit, and nobody should ever be pressured."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why BTCB and not Bitcoin?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract runs on BNB Smart Chain, which can run smart contracts. BTCB is Bitcoin's value on that chain, backed one to one by Bitcoin held by Binance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do I need BNB?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every transaction on BNB Smart Chain pays a small fee in BNB. Without BNB nothing moves, even with plenty of BTCB in your wallet."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get paid?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Payouts land in your own wallet in the same transaction as the activation that triggers them. There is no withdraw button and nobody to ask."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where do I buy with rand?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On VALR or Binance. Buy BNB, send it to SafePal on BNB Smart Chain (BEP20), then swap most of it to BTCB in SafePal."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I check it myself?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Paste the contract address into bscscan.com and look at the transactions. The Check it yourself page shows you how, step by step."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there an admin?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The contract has an owner wallet that can switch on an emergency mode and withdraw tokens the contract holds, among other settings. It is not renounced. We show this openly so you can judge for yourself."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this an official Bitcoin Wealth site?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It's MTG's independent guide. MTG is a member, and the sign-up button carries his referral link."}}],"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/bw/dashboard/faq/#faqpage"}]}</script>
 </head>
