mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is TAG Markets regulated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"TAG Markets' trading company, T.M. Financials Ltd, holds FSC Mauritius licence GB21026474, and TM Financials SA (Pty) Ltd is FSCA authorised, FSP 55237, for marketing services. If you live outside its licence area, check your local rules first."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are Sonic AI results real?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sonic AI publishes its track record on Myfxbook: +30.1% gross from 3 Nov 2024 to 4 Oct 2026. After the 70/30 split that is about 21% to the client over about 23 months: a real track record, with ups and downs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How big are the moves with 24x Amplify?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"24x Amplify makes every move bigger, in both directions. A built-in loss limit closes the account at a 10% loss of the starting balance (5% with a community token), and the broker's insolvency cover is $1,000,000 for all clients together."}}]}]}</script>
