 each one, with the sources, so you decide with your eyes open."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need trading experience?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. With copy trading you don't pick the trades: Sonic AI's trades are copied into your own account automatically. You choose the strategy, how much to put in and when to stop. Watch the 2:04 explainer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I have to recruit people to earn?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. As a client you earn from your own strategy, and 70% of every profit is yours. Sharing is optional: JetUP's partner program rewards members who help others start. See why people choose it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much do I need to start?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The sign-up training uses $155 in USDT or USDC: $50 goes into the Sonic AI strategy, $100 stays in your balance for the Dennis Fast Start Promo, and a few dollars stay spare. Start with an amount you're comfortable with, and grow from there."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there risk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, like any trading. Prices move both ways, and 24x Amplify makes every move bigger. That's why the plan starts small ($50 into Sonic AI), and a built-in loss limit closes the account at 10% of the starting balance (5% with a community token), so you know the line before you start."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this official JetUP or TAG Markets material?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. This is an independent guide by MTG. It quotes JetUP and TAG Markets where it uses their figures, and it shows you where to check them yourself."}}]},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP 5 Checks: lost money before? Check these 5 things before you try again","description":"MTG's honest explainer: who holds your money, who regulates TAG Markets, whether Sonic AI's results are real, what can go wrong with 24x Amplify, and how to get out.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.c