 <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/videos/#webpage","url":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/videos/","name":"JetUP and TAG Markets Videos: Trainings by MTG | MTG","description":"Watch the JetUP and TAG Markets videos: the 5 checks before you start, the sign-up training with Sonic AI and the Dennis promo, MTG's step-by-step phone videos (create your JetUP account, link TAG Markets) and JetUP's own Profit Share explainer.","inLanguage":"en-ZA","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/#website"},"author":{"@id":"https://mtgtribe.com/altruva/#mtg"},"datePublished":"2026-11-06","dateModified":"2026-11-06","about":[{"@type":"Organization","name":"TAG Markets","url":"https://tagmarkets.com/"},{"@type":"Organization","name":"JetUP","url":"https://jet-up.ai/"}],"primaryImageOfPage":"https://mtgtribe.com/assets/og/jetup-videos.jpg","breadcrumb":{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"MTG TRIBE","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"JetUP and TAG Markets","item":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Videos","item":"https://mtgtribe.com"}]}},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP and TAG Markets: the simple picture","description":"MTG's 1:39 explainer: JetUP is the community (it does not trade or take your money), TAG Markets is the broker where your account sits in your own name, CopyX copies the Sonic AI gold strategy, 70% of a profit is yours, and how to start.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-simple-picture-v3.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT1M39S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-the-simple-picture-v3.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Five names, one simple picture: JetUP, TAG Markets, CopyX, Sonic AI and you","description":"MTG's 2:08 explainer with a minibus taxi: Sonic AI is the driver, your seat is your TAG Markets account in your own name, CopyX is the route board, JetUP is the association that trains the passengers, and you decide which taxi and how much.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-who-does-what.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M8S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-who-does-what.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"What \"copying\" really means: CopyX copy trading explained with a cooking class","description":"MTG's 2:04 explainer with a cooking class: the chef at the front is Sonic AI, the strategy, and your own pot is your own account at TAG Markets, in your name. CopyX copies the strategy's trades into your account automatically, so you don't even lift the spoon: you don't pick the trades. You pick the strategy, how much to put in, and when to stop. Check Sonic AI's track record on Myfxbook first, read the terms (a 30% performance fee, taken from profits only), and watch every trade in MetaTrader 5 with your investor password, read only.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-what-copying-really-means.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M4S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-what-copying-really-means.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"The $100 Fast Start Promo: how it works and how to claim it","description":"MTG's 2:18 explainer: deposit $155, $50 goes to Sonic AI and $100 stays in your balance for the Dennis Fast Start Promo, which adds another $100 for a $200 promo account. Claim it on jet-up.ai in 4 steps with your CU number, and know the rules.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-100-promo.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M18S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-the-100-promo.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"The 70/30 split: where every profit goes","description":"MTG's 2:16 explainer: when Sonic AI makes a profit, 70% is yours and the 30% performance fee pays the broker, the strategy provider and the partner program. $10 becomes $7 for you, there is no fee on a losing trade, no management or join fee, and you can try your own numbers in the Profit Split Calculator.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-70-30-split-v2.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M16S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-the-70-30-split-v2.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Amplify 24x made simple: exposure is the size you trade with","description":"MTG's 2:13 explainer: Amplify lets an account trade at 24 times its size, like paying for one market stall and trading the size of 24. $50 becomes $1,200 and $200 becomes $4,800, which is $6,000 of exposure. Exposure is the size you trade with, not money you own, the loss limit is written down, and you can try your own numbers in the Exposure Calculator.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-amplify-24x-v2.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M13S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-amplify-24x-v2.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Know your numbers: the Exposure Calculator, tap by tap","description":"MTG's 2:03 walkthrough of his free Exposure Calculator for JetUP and TAG Markets: tap the training example ($150 plus the $100 bonus), read the $250 balance and the $6,000 exposure (the size you trade with, not money you own), type your own numbers with 24x Amplify, drag a price move (1% on $6,000 is $60, either direction), and know your lines: 2.5% equals your own $150, about 4.2% the whole balance, and the loss limit of 10% of the starting balance (5% with a community token).","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-know-your-numbers.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M3S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-know-your-numbers.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"The partner plan: the rule most people miss","description":"MTG's 2:18 explainer with ten glass floors and an access card: JetUP pays partners across 10 levels, but $250 of active trading opens 3. With 1 to 3 direct partners it stays 3; from the 4th direct partner each new one opens the next level, and 10 open all 10. Lot commission up to $8.00 per lot and Profit Share of 1.5% per open level, with JetUP's own figures.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-partner-plan.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M18S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-partner-plan.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"The Infinity Bonus: two strong wheels, the 50% rule and the difference rule","description":"MTG's 1:59 explainer of JetUP's Infinity Bonus with a bicycle with gears: a leadership bonus on top of the Profit Share, from level 1 with no depth limit; the rate is set by the team's new volume each month, from 1.5% at $50K to 7.5% at $40M, paid once a month; the 50% rule (the strongest line counts for at most half, so Infinity needs two strong lines) and the difference rule (3% minus a partner's 1.5% leaves 1.5% on their structure). JetUP's own figures.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-infinity-bonus.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT1M59S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-infinity-bonus.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Getting your money out: profits any time, and the promo's 12 months","description":"MTG's 2:06 explainer with a fruit tree in your own backyard: your TAG Markets account is in your own name, the tree is your own money and the fruit is your profit, which can be withdrawn any time. The promo's $100 bonus is released after 12 months, and taking your own money out before then ends the promo. Withdrawals go through the broker to your crypto wallet, on the same network on both sides, in about 48 hours on average (JetUP's one-pager). Start with one small withdrawal.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-explainer-getting-your-money-out.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M6S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-explainer-getting-your-money-out.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Sonic AI, the full picture: JetUP's own video","description":"JetUP's official 2:20 video on Sonic AI: why gold, how Sonic AI combines algorithmic trading with human traders, how copy trading repeats every trade in your own account, the last six closed months (JetUP's figures, May to October 2026, at 24x and before the 70/30 split), every trade on Myfxbook, the 70/30 split, how to start through the JetUP IB portal, TAG Markets and CopyX, the Dennis Promo and Amplify.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-sonic-ai-full-picture.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT2M20S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-sonic-ai-full-picture.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Meet your JetUP Assistant (Beta): JetUP's own video","description":"JetUP's official 51-second video on the JetUP Assistant, the AI helper in your JetUP Dashboard: give it a name, set a goal, get one next step every day, track your incentive progress, find people in your branch, see who is close to the next level and check your team's Dennis Promo (Check 100+100). The names and numbers in the video are JetUP's demo data.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-jetup-assistant.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT51S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-assistant-beta.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP 5 Checks: lost money before? Check these 5 things before you try again","description":"MTG's honest explainer: who holds your money, who regulates TAG Markets, whether Sonic AI's results are real, what can go wrong with 24x Amplify, and how to get out.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-5-checks-v5-3.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT5M25S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-5-checks-mtg-v5-3.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP and TAG Markets sign-up training: every tap shown","description":"Step-by-step training by MTG: create your JetUP account, link TAG Markets, verify your identity, fund your account, connect Sonic AI and claim the Dennis Fast Start Promo.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-signup-training-v4-4.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT9M9S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-tag-markets-signup-training-mtg-v4-4.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP step by step, part 1: create your JetUP account","description":"MTG's own recording, tap by tap: the Partner link, Individual, your real name, a password of 8 to 12 characters, country and phone, Register Now, verify your email, log in and check Account Type: Partner.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-tutorial-part-1-v3.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT3M46S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-tutorial-part-1-create-account-v4.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP step by step, part 2: link JetUP to TAG Markets","description":"MTG's own recording, tap by tap: log in to JetUP, tap Register CopyX on the CopyX banner, enter your JetUP password, tick the boxes, Sync Account, wait for User Active, log in to TAG Markets and confirm your email.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-tutorial-part-2-v2.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT3M42S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-tutorial-part-2-link-tag-markets-v4.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"JetUP step by step, part 3: verify your identity (KYC)","description":"MTG's own recording, tap by tap: upload documents on TAG Markets, Sumsub's check, your country, your Sumsub ID email and code, Create my account, Identity Card, double-sided, the tips, allow the camera, then the ID scan and the selfie.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-tutorial-part-3-v2.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT3M37S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-tutorial-part-3-verify-identity-v4.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Sonic AI in 64 seconds: JetUP's own video","description":"JetUP's official short video: Sonic AI copy trades one market, gold (XAU/USD), into your own TAG Markets account in your name. JetUP's figures for May to October 2026: 196 trades, 171 closed in profit (87.2%). Getting started in three steps.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-sonic-ai-v2.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT1M4S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-sonic-ai-gold-video.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"},{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Profit Share explained: JetUP's own 74-second video","description":"JetUP's official short explainer of the Sonic AI Profit Share across 10 levels, and how direct partners unlock them.","thumbnailUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/img/cover-profit-share.webp","uploadDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00+02:00","duration":"PT1M14S","contentUrl":"https://mtgtribe.com/jetup/media/jetup-profit-share-explained.mp4","inLanguage":"en-ZA"}]}</script>
